        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "AFL Premiership 2006 is a simulation game only for the PlayStation 2 based on the AFL. The game was developed by Australian games developer IR Gurus and was published by Sony Computer Entertainment under the SCEE label. It was released on 20 July 2006 and is the tenth game in the AFL video game series. The game was only released in Australia. Commentary includes, Dennis Cometti, Dermott Brereton, and Christi Malthouse.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "AFL Premiership 2006 es un juego de simulación exclusivo para PlayStation 2, basado en la AFL. Fue desarrollado por el estudio australiano IR Gurus y publicado por Sony Computer Entertainment bajo el sello SCEE. Se lanzó el 20 de julio de 2006 y es el décimo juego de la serie AFL. Solo se lanzó en Australia. Los comentaristas son Dennis Cometti, Dermott Brereton y Christi Malthouse.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
