        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "AFL Live is a sports game in the AFL series of Australian rules football video games. It was developed by Big Ant Studios for PlayStation 3, Xbox 360 and Microsoft Windows. It was released on 21 April 2011.[2][3] The Game of the Year Edition was released for The PlayStation Network and Xbox Live Marketplace on 6 June 2012 and was released for optical disc on 12 July 2012.[4] Commentary is provided by Dennis Cometti and Brian Taylor",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "AFL Live es un juego deportivo de la serie de videojuegos de fútbol australiano AFL. Fue desarrollado por Big Ant Studios para PlayStation 3, Xbox 360 y Microsoft Windows. Se lanzó el 21 de abril de 2011.[2][3] La edición Game of the Year se lanzó para PlayStation Network y Xbox Live Marketplace el 6 de junio de 2012, y en disco óptico el 12 de julio de 2012.[4] Los comentarios corren a cargo de Dennis Cometti y Brian Taylor.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
